{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Grow Your Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farming journey begins with seeds and soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the land, plant seeds, water the crops, and watch your produce grow over time. Use your tools to keep everything healthy and efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/0b14ccc438563c86fe87c188dfee2c0d.poster.avif?t=1764363512\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/0b14ccc438563c86fe87c188dfee2c0d.webm?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/0b14ccc438563c86fe87c188dfee2c0d.mp4?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Planting, watering, and harvesting your own fresh produce.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc04 Raise Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm is home to chickens, cows, and sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, care for them, and collect fresh eggs, milk, and wool. Animals bring life to your farm and valuable resources to your market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/29d4c138fb0f61ab17aad83e4ad28872.poster.avif?t=1764363512\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/29d4c138fb0f61ab17aad83e4ad28872.webm?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/29d4c138fb0f61ab17aad83e4ad28872.mp4?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take care of your chickens, cows, and sheep to produce fresh goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddfa Stock the Shelves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After harvesting, organize your products and place them on market shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what to sell and how to display it \u2014 keep your shop clean, full, and attractive to draw in customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/d5af70a752a6d070adecd2ffa5a25e4b.poster.avif?t=1764363512\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/d5af70a752a6d070adecd2ffa5a25e4b.webm?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/d5af70a752a6d070adecd2ffa5a25e4b.mp4?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restock your shelves with fresh produce and handmade goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Serve Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your market gets busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers wait in line, ready to buy. Scan their items, pack their bags, and make sure they leave happy. A fast checkout makes them love your store even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/df9f8a3ed14e96dbd4658138eccc76d2.poster.avif?t=1764363512\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/df9f8a3ed14e96dbd4658138eccc76d2.webm?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/df9f8a3ed14e96dbd4658138eccc76d2.mp4?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customers line up and you manage the checkout process.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb5 Handle Payments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the cashier, you\u2019ll collect money and give change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes sharp and hands quick \u2014 manage every sale and earn money to grow your market even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/fe00360f6e0e5b128ebd7dcfa7b73357.poster.avif?t=1764363512\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/fe00360f6e0e5b128ebd7dcfa7b73357.webm?t=1764363512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Receive payments and give correct change at the register.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434210?t=1764363512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434210?t=1764363512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/62b9aab27b0076ded1c0c7f05f99483ae72b3062/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764363512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/62b9aab27b0076ded1c0c7f05f99483ae72b3062/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764363512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom